WEBVTT

01:05.800 --> 01:06.880
Chen Maidong, right?

01:07.640 --> 01:08.560
Make it squeaky clean.

01:08.640 --> 01:09.920
What are you looking at?

01:10.960 --> 01:12.000
What's with the cocky look?

01:12.080 --> 01:13.680
Everyone knows about your family.

01:13.760 --> 01:15.640
Right. Your dad has a mistress.

01:15.720 --> 01:17.120
-Everyone knows.
-Precisely.

01:17.200 --> 01:19.040
Are you acting cocky
just because you're rich?

01:19.120 --> 01:20.520
Since your dad is having an affair,

01:20.600 --> 01:22.480
is your mom not returning home as well?

01:22.560 --> 01:24.240
Maybe she's having an affair too.

01:25.080 --> 01:26.080
I'm sure of it.

01:28.080 --> 01:29.400
Do you want to fight?

01:30.040 --> 01:31.520
Try and touch me if you dare!

01:36.400 --> 01:37.400
Come on.

01:39.880 --> 01:41.320
What are you doing?

01:41.400 --> 01:43.080
How dare you hit me?

01:44.880 --> 01:45.920
My goodness.

01:46.000 --> 01:48.480
He's quite good at putting up a front.

01:49.520 --> 01:50.680
Let's go.

01:50.760 --> 01:51.960
-Go.
-Let's just ignore him.

01:52.760 --> 01:54.200
-Hurry up.
-Let's go.

01:55.800 --> 01:56.800
Wait for me.

01:58.480 --> 01:59.320
-Chen Maidong!
-What are you doing?

01:59.400 --> 02:00.960
-What are you doing?
-What are you doing?

02:01.480 --> 02:02.520
-Chen Maidong!
-Stop!

02:02.600 --> 02:03.640
Come back!

02:04.600 --> 02:06.000
You're fighting for real, are you?

02:06.720 --> 02:07.600
Let go of me!

02:07.680 --> 02:09.120
Chen Maidong, let go!

02:13.160 --> 02:14.440
Go to hell, Chen Maidong!

02:14.920 --> 02:16.000
Enough!

02:16.520 --> 02:17.480
Enough!

03:39.760 --> 03:44.480
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

03:57.480 --> 03:59.240
PEOPLE'S GOVERNMENT
OF NANPING TOWN

04:01.480 --> 04:02.960
I'm not late, am I?

04:03.040 --> 04:03.960
Jie, you're here.

04:04.040 --> 04:05.760
Not at all. You're not late.

04:05.840 --> 04:06.680
Get a seat.

04:06.760 --> 04:08.840
Madam Wu, there's no need to rush.

04:08.920 --> 04:10.480
I usually run around for work.

04:10.560 --> 04:11.680
I'm already used to it.

04:12.560 --> 04:14.680
Hi, everyone. I'm Zhuang Jie.

04:15.640 --> 04:16.760
Song Xinran, right?

04:16.839 --> 04:18.760
Our first student
who majored in Arabic Studies.

04:18.839 --> 04:20.320
-I'll add you on WeChat later.
-Okay.

04:20.399 --> 04:21.600
What's your current occupation?

04:21.680 --> 04:22.520
I felt inadequate

04:22.600 --> 04:24.000
while working in the past few years.

04:24.080 --> 04:25.600
Now I'm focusing on my PhD.

04:25.680 --> 04:26.800
You're so good at studying.

04:26.880 --> 04:28.120
Pregnancy made me dumber.

04:28.200 --> 04:30.200
I've forgotten everything
I learned in university.

04:30.280 --> 04:32.760
Me too. I get sleepy
when I read books now.

04:32.840 --> 04:34.800
Everyone has their own expertise.

04:34.880 --> 04:36.680
Raising a child
is an exceptional ability too.

04:36.760 --> 04:38.760
Come. Let's add each other on WeChat.

04:38.840 --> 04:39.720
Here, scan my QR code.

04:43.760 --> 04:45.720
Zhuang Jie, where are you working now?

04:45.800 --> 04:46.840
The same place.

04:46.920 --> 04:49.080
Dalton Medical Products, a French company.

04:49.160 --> 04:50.800
I've worked there ever since I graduated.

04:50.880 --> 04:52.640
I envy white-collar workers like you.

04:52.720 --> 04:54.440
Businessmen like us put in so much effort.

04:54.520 --> 04:56.600
My hair turned white in just a few years.

04:56.680 --> 04:57.720
Who cares if it's white?

04:57.800 --> 04:59.720
It's better than going bald like me.

05:01.320 --> 05:02.520
All right, I'll add you.

05:02.600 --> 05:03.840
No job is easy.

05:03.920 --> 05:05.240
To be honest, folks,

05:05.320 --> 05:06.280
please come and find me

05:06.360 --> 05:07.640
if you need any medical products.

05:07.720 --> 05:09.040
Although I didn't major in that,

05:09.120 --> 05:10.000
I've learned a lot

05:10.080 --> 05:11.160
by being in the industry.

05:11.240 --> 05:12.400
We're all from the same town.

05:12.480 --> 05:14.160
-Let's help each other out.
-That's right.

05:14.240 --> 05:15.480
One more friend, one more way.

05:15.560 --> 05:17.320
Let's create a group chat
and keep in touch.

05:17.400 --> 05:18.240
Precisely.

05:18.320 --> 05:19.280
After working elsewhere,

05:19.360 --> 05:21.640
I feel that my friends here
are the closest to me.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.760
If we make friends in all kinds of trades,

05:23.840 --> 05:25.000
we won't get scammed

05:25.080 --> 05:26.320
when we buy something, right?

05:27.440 --> 05:28.880
Come, old friend.

05:28.960 --> 05:30.360
Let's add each other on WeChat.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.920
Do you wish
to add someone of my profession?

05:37.000 --> 05:39.080
Why can't I add someone
of your profession?

05:40.600 --> 05:42.120
I left in a hurry.

05:42.200 --> 05:43.840
I left my phone in the funeral parlor.

06:06.320 --> 06:07.400
Sorry about that.

06:07.480 --> 06:08.640
Thank you for waiting.

06:08.720 --> 06:10.960
-Sir, everyone has arrived.
-Okay.

06:11.040 --> 06:13.040
These are our town's local specialties.

06:13.120 --> 06:14.640
Distribute them to everyone.

06:14.720 --> 06:15.920
Let's thank the mayor

06:16.000 --> 06:18.000
for preparing
such wonderful hometown snacks.

06:18.080 --> 06:20.360
-Hello, sir.
-Hello, everyone.

06:20.440 --> 06:21.520
Please be seated.

06:21.600 --> 06:22.880
Okay.

06:22.960 --> 06:25.600
Actually, I've been wanting
to hold a gathering with all of you.

06:25.680 --> 06:27.840
Initially, I wanted to hold it
during Chinese New Year.

06:27.920 --> 06:29.800
But you all returned
for the Labor Day holiday.

06:29.880 --> 06:32.000
In that case,
there's no time better than now.

06:32.920 --> 06:34.320
I know many of you

06:34.400 --> 06:36.800
were born in Nanping and grew up here.

06:37.360 --> 06:38.880
But please pardon me for being frank.

06:38.960 --> 06:41.640
You might not know your hometown
as well as you think.

06:42.280 --> 06:43.600
You might not understand

06:43.680 --> 06:46.240
how urgently we need you to come back.

06:46.800 --> 06:47.840
Ma.

06:47.920 --> 06:49.320
BEAUTIFUL HOMETOWN

06:49.400 --> 06:51.160
All of us know

06:51.240 --> 06:52.680
that Nanping is quite a wealthy town

06:52.760 --> 06:54.240
with listed pharmaceutical factories,

06:54.320 --> 06:56.000
large-scale electric appliance factories,

06:56.080 --> 06:58.160
and internationally renowned
porcelain factories.

06:58.240 --> 07:01.840
Our tourism and aquaculture sectors
are commendable as well.

07:01.920 --> 07:03.960
I'll stop bragging about our hometown.

07:04.040 --> 07:05.200
I'll talk about

07:05.280 --> 07:06.640
the things we're worried about.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.040
Our pharmaceutical factories

07:08.120 --> 07:09.680
plan to relocate to the city

07:09.760 --> 07:10.640
in five years,

07:10.720 --> 07:12.080
directly causing the unemployment

07:12.160 --> 07:13.800
of thousands of people.

07:13.880 --> 07:16.000
Our tourism sector

07:16.080 --> 07:18.200
isn't as vibrant as what people say.

07:18.280 --> 07:20.520
The disparity between the peak season
and non-peak season

07:20.600 --> 07:21.720
is rather concerning.

07:21.800 --> 07:24.480
And the industrial zone
that is being built right now

07:24.560 --> 07:27.120
has empty factories
as far as our eyes can see.

07:28.400 --> 07:29.960
Therefore, I'm here

07:30.040 --> 07:33.040
to sincerely seek help from all of you.

07:33.120 --> 07:35.080
I hope you can think of a solution

07:35.160 --> 07:36.160
for our town

07:36.240 --> 07:38.760
based on your experience and knowledge.

07:39.560 --> 07:41.760
Our town doesn't lack money.

07:41.840 --> 07:42.960
We lack talented individuals.

07:43.040 --> 07:45.480
Capable youngsters like you

07:45.560 --> 07:47.880
usually don't return
after leaving for university.

07:47.960 --> 07:49.160
I don't expect you

07:49.240 --> 07:50.800
to remain in this town.

07:51.480 --> 07:52.720
I just hope

07:52.800 --> 07:56.040
that you can visit your hometown often.

07:56.640 --> 07:57.560
Give us some ideas

07:58.400 --> 07:59.640
to help out the town.

08:01.440 --> 08:03.040
My gratitude knows no bounds.

08:04.520 --> 08:06.240
TO THE YOUTHS OF NANPING TOWN

08:08.280 --> 08:09.640
Besides that, over here,

08:09.720 --> 08:11.320
I would like to introduce someone.

08:11.400 --> 08:12.680
Chen Maidong.

08:13.880 --> 08:16.000
He was the first person
to return here from a first-tier city.

08:16.800 --> 08:18.280
He's a talented youth

08:18.840 --> 08:21.760
who takes care of his grandmother
while helping the town out.

08:22.440 --> 08:25.520
And he's working in a funeral parlor,
which is a noble occupation.

08:26.640 --> 08:28.040
Our town

08:28.120 --> 08:29.720
is always filled with lonely old folks.

08:29.800 --> 08:31.280
Their bodies are only discovered

08:31.360 --> 08:33.039
after they have passed away for some time.

08:33.120 --> 08:35.080
Ever since his return,

08:35.159 --> 08:36.760
not only did he help the deceased

08:36.840 --> 08:38.080
regain their pride,

08:38.159 --> 08:40.159
but he has also helped out
the old folks' homes

08:40.240 --> 08:42.039
and lonely old residents.

08:42.120 --> 08:45.320
Even the province sent a team here
just to learn from him.

08:46.000 --> 08:47.520
This is what I was saying earlier.

08:48.040 --> 08:49.800
As long as we have talented individuals,

08:50.280 --> 08:52.880
all obstacles will be resolved.

08:52.960 --> 08:54.440
KEEP TO ONESELF WHEN IN DISTRESS

08:56.480 --> 08:58.960
However, it's our negligence

08:59.560 --> 09:00.680
for failing to find a partner

09:01.760 --> 09:03.560
for our role model here.

09:04.720 --> 09:06.960
Since all of you are here,

09:07.720 --> 09:08.800
those who are single

09:09.360 --> 09:10.720
should take a look around.

09:11.720 --> 09:14.720
Let's resolve this internally if possible.

09:14.800 --> 09:16.680
Let's keep the goods within the family.

09:16.760 --> 09:17.720
Am I right?

09:18.200 --> 09:19.520
I'm sure all of you know

09:19.600 --> 09:20.720
whether you're single or not.

09:21.360 --> 09:23.400
Don't force me to call out your names.

09:23.920 --> 09:24.840
You may not be worried,

09:24.920 --> 09:26.800
but your parents are very worried.

09:27.680 --> 09:30.120
Of course, this is
a top priority for the town.

09:30.800 --> 09:32.280
He's still pretending to be cool.

09:32.360 --> 09:34.160
If you don't believe me,
then look at Madam Wu.

09:34.240 --> 09:36.400
She's so worried
that her brows are constantly furrowed!

09:39.480 --> 09:40.640
All right.

09:40.720 --> 09:42.080
That's all I have to say today.

09:42.960 --> 09:44.080
I have another meeting.

09:44.160 --> 09:45.440
Don't leave so soon.

09:45.520 --> 09:48.040
You can talk and interact with each other.

09:48.120 --> 09:49.280
Chat with each other, okay?

09:49.960 --> 09:51.080
I'll make a move first.

09:51.160 --> 09:52.000
Thank you, sir.

09:52.080 --> 09:53.320
Okay. See you guys around.

09:53.400 --> 09:54.280
Goodbye.

09:55.760 --> 09:57.200
-Let them chat.
-Okay.

09:57.280 --> 09:58.800
-Okay.
-Don't leave yet. I'll be back soon.

09:58.880 --> 09:59.880
-Have a nice chat.
-Okay.

10:01.360 --> 10:02.240
That's what you get.

10:04.280 --> 10:05.480
Did you drive here?

10:06.200 --> 10:07.080
I did.

10:07.600 --> 10:09.000
It's the workplace vehicle.

10:09.080 --> 10:10.360
What do you mean?

10:11.480 --> 10:12.600
It's a hearse.

10:15.440 --> 10:17.040
Fine, I won't bother you.

10:17.120 --> 10:17.960
See you around.

10:19.200 --> 10:20.680
You brought that upon yourself.

10:32.360 --> 10:34.520
Wasn't my prosthetic limb made
with the newest materials?

10:34.600 --> 10:36.240
Buddy, it's faulty after only six months.

10:36.320 --> 10:37.680
Did you scam me?

10:38.680 --> 10:41.360
Hold on. I'm sure it's deformed
due to wear and tear.

10:41.440 --> 10:43.640
Would I not be able to walk
after bumping into something?

10:47.640 --> 10:49.840
Wait. What do you mean
by my strides are too wide?

10:49.920 --> 10:51.080
Don't try to be a smart aleck.

10:54.000 --> 10:56.080
I know it has vertical damping

10:56.160 --> 10:57.400
and rotational torque functions.

10:57.480 --> 10:59.720
If not, why would I pay you so much
in the first place?

11:02.680 --> 11:04.040
Forget it.

11:04.120 --> 11:05.640
I'll get on your case
when I return to Shanghai.

12:07.000 --> 12:07.880
Hop on.

13:01.680 --> 13:02.800
You're getting heavier.

14:37.280 --> 14:38.840
You can just hold onto my shirt.

14:38.920 --> 14:40.120
That's kind of dangerous.

14:40.760 --> 14:41.800
You do cherish your life.

14:43.480 --> 14:45.280
Are you afraid of someone
hugging your waist?

14:45.360 --> 14:46.360
Do you have a spare tire?

14:51.160 --> 14:52.520
Why are you so talkative now?

14:52.600 --> 14:54.040
I was talkative from the start.

14:54.120 --> 14:55.680
You weren't like this before.

14:55.760 --> 14:56.840
Like what?

14:56.920 --> 14:58.720
-Extroverted.
-Isn't that good?

14:58.800 --> 15:00.280
Didn't you realize that I alone

15:00.360 --> 15:02.280
changed the awkward vibe
of the meeting earlier?

15:03.280 --> 15:05.760
Please be quiet.
At least you won't be that annoying.

15:05.840 --> 15:06.800
Not at all.

15:06.880 --> 15:08.640
I think everyone likes me.

15:10.680 --> 15:11.720
Chen Maidong,

15:11.800 --> 15:13.680
do you feel uncomfortable?

15:15.280 --> 15:16.240
Chen Maidong,

15:16.320 --> 15:18.560
don't tell me you still think
I have feelings for you.

15:22.240 --> 15:24.560
To be honest,
when I saw you on the bullet train,

15:24.640 --> 15:26.880
even though I didn't recognize you,

15:26.960 --> 15:29.400
I think my heart still skipped a beat.

15:29.480 --> 15:30.400
I thought to myself

15:30.480 --> 15:32.440
that this guy looks so refined.

15:32.520 --> 15:33.840
He looks like my cup of tea.

15:33.920 --> 15:35.200
When I took a closer look,

15:35.960 --> 15:37.800
it was Chen Maidong, my old flame!

15:39.640 --> 15:40.840
Why did you suddenly brake?

15:40.920 --> 15:41.880
Get off.

15:41.960 --> 15:43.240
Give me your crutch.

15:43.320 --> 15:45.720
Where do you see me have a crutch?

15:47.520 --> 15:49.360
I was just teasing you.
Why are you robbing me?

15:49.440 --> 15:50.360
You threw my bag!

15:50.440 --> 15:51.720
Old man, what are you doing?

15:51.800 --> 15:52.760
I'll call the cops!

16:02.400 --> 16:03.400
Hey.

16:03.480 --> 16:05.000
You keep feeding me sweets

16:05.080 --> 16:06.800
even when I'm at this age.

16:06.880 --> 16:08.760
Are you up to no good?

16:08.840 --> 16:10.800
At your age,

16:10.880 --> 16:12.480
I'll be up to no good

16:12.560 --> 16:14.720
if I don't allow you to eat sweets.

16:16.400 --> 16:17.640
I guess I'm old now.

16:17.720 --> 16:18.920
Everyone calls me a granny

16:19.000 --> 16:20.560
when they see me in public.

16:20.640 --> 16:23.320
Time is just like a bridge.

16:23.880 --> 16:25.840
Every one of us has to walk from one side

16:25.920 --> 16:27.200
to the other side.

16:27.280 --> 16:28.720
At our age,

16:28.800 --> 16:29.920
we've almost

16:30.000 --> 16:31.120
reached the other side.

16:31.840 --> 16:33.560
Now we can just sit and wait

16:33.640 --> 16:35.640
for the others to cross the bridge.

16:36.200 --> 16:37.520
Although that's the case,

16:37.600 --> 16:39.280
times are different now.

16:39.360 --> 16:40.680
While waiting on the other side,

16:40.760 --> 16:42.400
I want to see what the youth are doing

16:42.480 --> 16:44.520
and impart some life experiences to them.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.440
But now, I feel

16:46.520 --> 16:48.560
like I'm useless.

16:48.640 --> 16:50.920
I have to depend
on my grandson to teach me.

16:51.000 --> 16:52.200
The older you get,

16:52.280 --> 16:54.040
the more questions you have.

16:54.120 --> 16:56.520
That's why you want
to do divination all the time.

16:57.680 --> 16:58.600
Speaking of which,

16:58.680 --> 17:01.360
those tarot cards of yours

17:01.440 --> 17:02.640
are indeed nonsense.

17:02.720 --> 17:03.640
After that,

17:03.720 --> 17:05.359
I intimidated those two

17:05.440 --> 17:06.359
by telling them

17:06.440 --> 17:08.119
that they were destined to be together.

17:08.839 --> 17:10.880
You need affinity

17:11.400 --> 17:13.760
to be able to intimidate them too.

17:13.839 --> 17:15.520
For some reason,

17:15.599 --> 17:17.200
I like Jie.

17:17.920 --> 17:19.920
She's just like a younger version of me.

17:20.960 --> 17:22.000
But after that,

17:22.079 --> 17:24.400
she told me wholeheartedly

17:25.359 --> 17:26.800
that she doesn't want to stay here.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.240
She's going to return to Shanghai.

17:28.319 --> 17:30.400
Then I felt like she wasn't like me.

17:30.480 --> 17:33.400
I spent my entire life in this very town.

17:34.280 --> 17:35.880
Even now, I think

17:35.960 --> 17:37.520
that it's a great place

17:37.600 --> 17:39.360
since it has natural sceneries,

17:39.440 --> 17:40.520
buildings, houses,

17:40.600 --> 17:42.200
and nice people.

17:42.280 --> 17:44.800
Look at all those big cities
filled with concrete and cement.

17:44.880 --> 17:46.880
And it's so noisy there.
What's so good about them?

17:46.960 --> 17:50.000
You can't just compare yourself

17:50.080 --> 17:52.160
to women nowadays.

17:52.880 --> 17:54.200
Women of this generation

17:54.280 --> 17:56.120
are very independent.

17:56.200 --> 17:58.720
The home they're looking for is a place

17:58.800 --> 18:01.680
where they can rest both body and soul.

18:02.800 --> 18:04.000
Speaking of which,

18:04.080 --> 18:06.160
the poem you taught me to recite

18:06.240 --> 18:08.120
is truly fitting.

18:08.920 --> 18:11.040
I was born without a home

18:11.640 --> 18:13.360
Home is where the heart is

18:15.960 --> 18:17.440
To Jie,

18:18.280 --> 18:20.080
Nanping is a great place.

18:20.640 --> 18:22.680
I don't think
it'll be difficult to keep her here.

18:23.320 --> 18:25.040
Now it depends on

18:25.120 --> 18:26.720
whether or not Maidong is lucky enough

18:26.800 --> 18:28.240
to win her heart.

18:40.120 --> 18:42.880
Chen Maidong, you're ruthless.

18:42.960 --> 18:45.000
This bag is more precious than me.

18:46.160 --> 18:47.120
Zhuang Jie.

18:49.800 --> 18:51.560
Your leg looked fine

18:52.680 --> 18:54.120
when you kicked that person.

18:55.040 --> 18:57.120
It was all thanks to adrenaline. Got it?

18:57.200 --> 18:58.280
But speaking of which,

18:58.360 --> 19:00.040
my custom-made prosthetic limb
wasn't free.

19:00.120 --> 19:02.080
Although there was a problem
with the socket,

19:02.160 --> 19:03.960
it'll still be wearable
after I get used to it.

19:04.840 --> 19:05.840
So

19:07.200 --> 19:08.560
were you joking with me all along?

19:09.840 --> 19:11.320
Don't tell me you think I…

19:15.960 --> 19:16.960
Joking with you?

19:18.280 --> 19:19.440
Which part do you mean?

19:19.920 --> 19:21.240
When I pretended to limp?

19:21.320 --> 19:22.560
Or when I said

19:23.320 --> 19:25.480
you are my cup of tea and my old flame?

19:29.640 --> 19:30.480
Both.

19:37.760 --> 19:38.880
Both are true.

19:39.840 --> 19:41.360
But both can be false as well.

19:42.000 --> 19:43.760
It depends on how you interpret it.

19:46.720 --> 19:47.960
You're something else.

19:50.040 --> 19:51.760
You've changed entirely.

19:54.600 --> 19:55.800
It's not that bad.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.920
Life is short.

19:58.000 --> 19:59.720
There's no need to be serious.

20:00.840 --> 20:04.000
For example, all those youngsters
who joined the meeting this afternoon

20:04.080 --> 20:05.720
were passionate and hot-blooded.

20:06.280 --> 20:07.720
But once they step out the door,

20:07.800 --> 20:09.680
when the wind blows and the dust settles,

20:09.760 --> 20:10.840
no one will remember

20:10.920 --> 20:11.920
their promises.

20:12.600 --> 20:14.720
The town's meat processing plant
was an investment

20:14.800 --> 20:17.080
that the Wang family's second son got
from Beijing.

20:18.320 --> 20:20.080
Terraced fields
will be built on the hills.

20:20.160 --> 20:22.720
Yanggou Village has planted
tens of mus of yams.

20:23.320 --> 20:26.640
All of these were contributed
by youngsters working in other provinces.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.440
Zhuang Jie,

20:30.280 --> 20:32.040
you came here when you were a teen.

20:32.120 --> 20:33.880
It's understandable
that you aren't attached.

20:34.480 --> 20:35.480
But that doesn't mean

20:35.560 --> 20:37.640
that everyone loves
to run their mouths like you.

20:43.440 --> 20:46.160
Chen Maidong, do you think
I am less self-aware than you?

20:46.240 --> 20:48.960
Do you think I became the top saleswoman
due to pure luck?

20:49.040 --> 20:50.480
Tomorrow, I'll show you.

20:50.560 --> 20:52.240
I'll show you!

20:52.320 --> 20:55.000
I'll show you how much I can contribute
to my hometown!

21:02.040 --> 21:02.920
Mom!

21:03.680 --> 21:04.640
Mom!

21:06.160 --> 21:07.520
Mom!

21:09.040 --> 21:09.920
I need the crutches!

21:11.480 --> 21:12.680
Yan,

21:12.760 --> 21:14.320
now you believe me, right?

21:14.880 --> 21:16.920
Our sister is being gaslighted.

21:17.640 --> 21:18.760
That might be true.

21:23.400 --> 21:25.880
Keep an eye on Taixin Healthcare.

21:25.960 --> 21:28.200
Their respiratory pumps
should've been replaced long ago.

21:28.280 --> 21:30.200
I'll do a follow-up
once I return to Shanghai.

21:30.680 --> 21:31.600
Don't worry about it.

21:31.680 --> 21:32.960
I won't let anything escape me.

21:33.840 --> 21:35.440
The new girl who joined our company

21:35.520 --> 21:37.080
wanted to proceed with the deal.

21:37.160 --> 21:38.240
I dealt with her.

21:38.320 --> 21:39.440
She has no respect for us.

21:40.920 --> 21:42.200
She's new.

21:42.280 --> 21:44.680
It's common for her
to try to make a name for herself.

21:44.760 --> 21:46.800
But she won't be able to close the deal.

21:46.880 --> 21:48.600
Yes. They're ice-cold.

21:48.680 --> 21:50.280
Ordinary salespeople cannot stand them.

21:50.360 --> 21:53.320
You're the only person
who can close the deal.

21:53.400 --> 21:55.360
Honestly, I didn't really suffer anything.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.000
Since I'm disabled,

21:57.080 --> 21:58.560
they showed me a lot of respect.

21:58.640 --> 21:59.920
It takes a strong heart

22:00.000 --> 22:02.080
for one to turn their disabilities
into their strengths

22:02.160 --> 22:03.880
with such an open mind.

22:04.800 --> 22:06.560
How did you manage to do it?

22:06.640 --> 22:08.720
I remember that you were introverted
in high school.

22:08.800 --> 22:09.800
You even avoided people

22:09.880 --> 22:10.960
when going to the restroom.

22:11.040 --> 22:12.280
I was enlightened by a sage.

22:12.360 --> 22:14.200
Really? Who is it?

22:14.280 --> 22:15.520
How could I not know about that?

22:16.080 --> 22:18.400
What? Do you think you know everything?

22:19.240 --> 22:20.320
You do have a point.

22:20.400 --> 22:23.160
Back then, you were already very creative.

22:23.240 --> 22:24.920
You were super mysterious
and unpredictable.

22:25.000 --> 22:25.920
Nonsense.

22:26.000 --> 22:28.720
High school students are silly.
There was nothing mysterious about me.

22:28.800 --> 22:30.960
Tell me, then. Who was it?

22:33.320 --> 22:34.360
Chen Maidong.

22:35.520 --> 22:37.120
He was the first person who told me

22:37.200 --> 22:39.360
that a crutch
could be used as a weapon too.

22:42.120 --> 22:44.680
Have you two actually
talked about that before?

22:44.760 --> 22:46.200
When did it happen?

22:46.280 --> 22:47.680
Enough already.

22:47.760 --> 22:50.120
I can already imagine
that nosy look on your face.

22:50.200 --> 22:52.920
It's because there's something fishy
about your tone.

22:53.000 --> 22:53.920
Tell me about it.

22:54.000 --> 22:55.920
How did you two get together back then?

22:56.000 --> 22:57.000
What are you saying?

22:57.080 --> 22:58.840
We didn't even speak much to each other.

22:58.920 --> 23:00.160
Stop pretending.

23:00.240 --> 23:01.680
The vibe between you two

23:01.760 --> 23:03.120
is enough for us
to gossip for years, okay?

23:17.240 --> 23:18.320
Is anyone else in there?

23:19.600 --> 23:20.440
I…

23:21.240 --> 23:22.280
I'm the only person.

23:24.320 --> 23:25.320
Here.

23:31.520 --> 23:33.680
Do I have to bring it to you too?

23:33.760 --> 23:35.240
Why don't you use me as your crutch?

23:36.480 --> 23:37.560
Take it.

23:47.320 --> 23:48.720
I'm a disabled individual.

23:48.800 --> 23:50.560
My limbs aren't as good as yours.

23:53.360 --> 23:54.920
You didn't apologize to me

23:57.440 --> 23:59.680
or thank me either.

24:05.520 --> 24:06.920
I was teaching you.

24:07.480 --> 24:09.760
A crutch can be used as a weapon too.

24:10.680 --> 24:12.440
The crutch is wasted on you.

24:13.760 --> 24:16.080
Who are you trying
to show your pitiful face to?

24:17.000 --> 24:18.600
Speak for yourself.

24:18.680 --> 24:21.320
Who are you trying
to show your spiteful face to?

24:33.200 --> 24:34.520
Don't tell me you're going

24:35.280 --> 24:36.840
to hit a disabled woman.

24:43.440 --> 24:46.160
No one will treat you
as a disabled individual

24:46.800 --> 24:48.760
if you don't talk about it all the time.

24:52.360 --> 24:54.000
Speak for yourself.

24:54.960 --> 24:56.920
Only the guilty fear gossip.

24:57.000 --> 24:58.160
If you don't want to listen,

24:58.240 --> 24:59.520
just plug your ears.

25:00.320 --> 25:01.640
You keep getting into fights.

25:01.720 --> 25:02.760
Can you defeat all of them?

25:14.440 --> 25:15.560
The crutch is wet, isn't it?

25:18.120 --> 25:19.440
I can walk by myself.

25:20.480 --> 25:21.720
As if I'm concerned about you.

25:26.680 --> 25:28.000
Chen Maidong,

25:28.080 --> 25:29.520
you owe me a favor.

25:36.040 --> 25:36.960
Fine.

25:37.920 --> 25:39.720
I'll return the favor the way you want it.

25:42.320 --> 25:43.400
What about Chen Maidong?

25:44.240 --> 25:45.640
He has no role in the play.

25:47.560 --> 25:49.440
He and I will be the two trees.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.240
Zhuang Jie,

26:07.160 --> 26:08.680
you're pretty courageous, aren't you?

26:09.360 --> 26:12.560
It seems everyone was wrong
about you back then.

26:16.800 --> 26:18.320
Maybe the crutch I used during my youth

26:18.400 --> 26:19.800
sealed me away for a while.

26:20.400 --> 26:22.280
But I started living my life

26:22.360 --> 26:24.120
after Chen Maidong undid the seal.

26:27.000 --> 26:29.640
If that's the case,

26:30.320 --> 26:34.000
were all those intimate moments
between you and him

26:35.360 --> 26:37.520
part of your plan from the start?

26:37.600 --> 26:39.280
Get lost.

26:39.360 --> 26:42.000
Why does everything sound wrong
when it comes from you?

26:42.080 --> 26:42.960
I'll hang up now.

26:45.200 --> 26:46.040
Hello?

27:04.880 --> 27:06.680
-Zhuang Jie.
-We're going now. Goodbye.

27:28.560 --> 27:30.360
Are you dumb?
Why didn't you bring an umbrella?

27:30.440 --> 27:31.720
You're the dumb one here.

27:32.520 --> 27:34.240
It's inconvenient for me
to use an umbrella.

27:34.320 --> 27:35.560
It's a burden for me.

27:38.240 --> 27:39.400
Can't you afford a raincoat?

27:40.320 --> 27:42.200
I don't like it. It looks ugly.

27:51.880 --> 27:52.720
Get on.

27:55.440 --> 27:56.760
I can't jump up.

28:21.280 --> 28:22.480
You're so heavy.

28:37.880 --> 28:40.200
Look, it's Chen Maidong and Zhuang Jie.

28:40.280 --> 28:41.360
You're right.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.600
Since when were they this close?

28:44.960 --> 28:46.160
Chen Maidong,

28:46.240 --> 28:47.800
you must've done something wrong again.

28:47.880 --> 28:49.600
Did the teacher make you carry Zhuang Jie?

28:50.600 --> 28:51.680
Do you need any help?

28:52.440 --> 28:54.200
Look at him. He's as cocky as ever.

28:54.280 --> 28:55.200
Precisely.

28:55.280 --> 28:56.600
Let's go.

29:14.520 --> 29:16.000
Where did you go? It's so late.

29:17.080 --> 29:18.480
You know that it's late too, do you?

29:18.560 --> 29:19.680
I was planning to find you.

29:19.760 --> 29:21.680
Of all the functions
to learn on a smartphone,

29:21.760 --> 29:23.360
you learn to silence it and turn it off.

29:23.440 --> 29:24.560
I can't even find you.

29:24.640 --> 29:25.720
Enough. Stop nagging.

29:25.800 --> 29:26.960
You sound like an old man.

29:27.040 --> 29:27.920
It's dark now.

29:28.000 --> 29:29.440
You should've sent me a voice message

29:29.520 --> 29:31.000
or told me when you would be back.

29:31.080 --> 29:32.520
How many times have I told you this?

29:32.600 --> 29:33.800
I don't like to be interrupted

29:33.880 --> 29:35.080
when I chat with my friends.

29:35.160 --> 29:36.840
I've taken the same path my entire life.

29:36.920 --> 29:37.760
Why would I get lost?

29:37.840 --> 29:39.280
You're worried for nothing.

29:39.360 --> 29:40.800
Fine, it's my fault.

29:43.040 --> 29:44.240
Tell me what is your fault.

29:44.800 --> 29:45.720
Everything is my fault.

29:45.800 --> 29:47.080
You're brushing me off.

29:47.640 --> 29:49.920
It's your fault
for not having a nightlife.

29:50.000 --> 29:51.720
That's why you keep bothering me.

29:51.800 --> 29:54.600
I was pretty happy
when I saw that you were heading out.

29:55.560 --> 29:57.440
He has grown up and asked Jie out--

29:57.520 --> 29:58.720
Please stop.

29:58.800 --> 29:59.640
Stop right there.

30:00.880 --> 30:02.240
What the heck is wrong with her?

30:02.320 --> 30:03.400
I'm sure she has gone mad.

30:15.960 --> 30:17.400
You two must've lost your mind!

30:17.480 --> 30:18.600
Speak for yourself!

30:20.200 --> 30:22.040
Speak now or never. Otherwise, dismissed.

30:27.320 --> 30:29.520
Jie, actually,

30:30.160 --> 30:31.240
let me say this first.

30:31.320 --> 30:32.400
What is this?

30:32.480 --> 30:33.440
Is this a facial mask?

30:33.520 --> 30:36.120
Jie, why are you
wearing a helmet to sleep?

30:36.760 --> 30:38.360
Are you addicted to riding motorcycles?

30:42.400 --> 30:43.480
Although I'm wearing a mask,

30:43.560 --> 30:44.400
I'm not blind.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.880
I can see what you two are doing,

30:45.960 --> 30:46.840
all right?

30:47.600 --> 30:49.880
Jie, we're truly worried about you.

30:49.960 --> 30:51.400
Why do you say so?

30:51.480 --> 30:52.920
Actually, we found out

30:53.000 --> 30:55.080
about your relationship with Chen Maidong.

30:56.200 --> 30:57.040
Which part?

30:58.040 --> 30:59.320
Stop trying to avoid the topic.

30:59.800 --> 31:01.720
Chen Maidong does have a great image.

31:02.320 --> 31:03.200
He Niaoniao.

31:03.280 --> 31:04.120
However,

31:04.920 --> 31:06.960
this playboy relied on his good looks

31:07.040 --> 31:08.200
and toyed with you back then.

31:08.280 --> 31:10.080
Now he's trying to do the same thing.

31:10.600 --> 31:11.840
We'll never agree to it.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.920
Chen Maidong? Playboy?

31:14.000 --> 31:15.040
Who told you?

31:15.120 --> 31:16.360
I don't believe it either.

31:16.440 --> 31:18.400
I suspect she watched too many dramas.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.280
Yan, how could you say that?

31:21.880 --> 31:24.080
You were the one who said
Jie was the local ugly duckling

31:24.160 --> 31:26.040
and had the potential of getting tricked.

31:26.120 --> 31:27.280
I told you that in confidence.

31:27.360 --> 31:29.000
Why are you telling her?

31:29.080 --> 31:31.280
-You're leaking all our secrets.
-You're the traitor.

31:31.360 --> 31:32.600
You're a terrible teammate.

31:38.000 --> 31:40.040
There's nothing between us.

31:40.800 --> 31:42.680
Chen Maidong is pretty nice.

31:42.760 --> 31:44.040
He helped me out before.

31:44.120 --> 31:45.480
But you see,

31:46.000 --> 31:47.360
he never fell for me.

31:47.440 --> 31:48.960
We were just classmates.

31:49.600 --> 31:51.320
Why does he not like you?

31:53.080 --> 31:54.800
That's not it.
He just didn't fall for her.

31:54.880 --> 31:55.760
He Niaoniao,

31:55.840 --> 31:57.400
your analytical skills are problematic.

31:58.440 --> 31:59.880
Why did he not fall for you?

31:59.960 --> 32:02.040
Who knows? I didn't look into it.

32:02.120 --> 32:02.960
If so,

32:03.480 --> 32:05.200
Jie, do you like him?

32:14.440 --> 32:15.520
To be honest,

32:17.200 --> 32:18.400
I don't know what it feels like

32:18.480 --> 32:20.640
to genuinely like someone.

32:24.040 --> 32:25.280
Here, give it a try.

32:35.440 --> 32:36.440
Chen Maidong.

32:38.400 --> 32:39.440
Talk.

32:40.560 --> 32:41.400
About what?

32:42.200 --> 32:43.120
Stop pretending.

32:47.400 --> 32:48.960
I attended the meeting this afternoon.

32:49.480 --> 32:50.840
I encountered Zhuang Jie.

32:53.040 --> 32:54.560
But we didn't have a chance to talk.

32:54.640 --> 32:56.080
After that, her leg started aching.

32:56.160 --> 32:57.320
I gave her a ride on my bike.

32:58.280 --> 32:59.480
And then?

32:59.560 --> 33:00.720
That's all.

33:00.800 --> 33:01.840
I rebuked her.

33:01.920 --> 33:03.400
You actually rebuked Jie?

33:04.520 --> 33:06.040
She doesn't speak nicely at all.

33:06.680 --> 33:08.440
She was much better when she was younger.

33:09.000 --> 33:10.240
And she's noisy.

33:10.320 --> 33:11.400
I bet even dogs hate her.

33:11.480 --> 33:12.520
You!

33:13.160 --> 33:14.680
More like dogs hate you!

33:15.880 --> 33:16.960
Chen Maidong,

33:17.040 --> 33:19.400
are you mentally ill?

33:19.480 --> 33:22.520
Are you actually picking faults
with a fine girl like Jie?

33:24.480 --> 33:26.480
Our personalities don't match at all.

33:28.760 --> 33:30.440
You have two choices.

33:31.360 --> 33:32.320
First choice,

33:32.400 --> 33:34.080
come with me to the TCM center tomorrow

33:34.160 --> 33:36.960
and see if you're sick in the head
or down below.

33:37.560 --> 33:38.480
Grandma.

33:38.560 --> 33:39.720
If you're sick,

33:39.800 --> 33:41.200
I'll sell all my possessions

33:41.280 --> 33:42.960
to treat your disease.

33:43.720 --> 33:45.000
If you're not sick,

33:45.760 --> 33:46.880
here's your second choice.

33:46.960 --> 33:48.120
From now on,

33:48.200 --> 33:49.880
you had better court Jie properly.

33:49.960 --> 33:51.840
If you dare to offend her,

33:51.920 --> 33:53.320
I'll break your legs.

33:54.240 --> 33:56.360
You had better do everything you can

33:56.440 --> 33:59.560
to please her while she is still here.

34:03.560 --> 34:05.080
Chen Maidong, what's your choice?

34:05.160 --> 34:06.120
Did you hear me?

34:06.880 --> 34:07.840
I did.

34:08.320 --> 34:09.320
I'll court her.

34:09.400 --> 34:10.840
Start tomorrow.

34:10.920 --> 34:12.040
I'm busy tomorrow.

34:12.120 --> 34:13.000
You!

34:14.080 --> 34:17.239
You're forcing me
to make an appearance, aren't you?

34:17.320 --> 34:19.239
You had better not regret it!

34:24.920 --> 34:27.520
I once read about this in a picture book.

34:30.480 --> 34:31.920
"The feeling of liking someone

34:32.000 --> 34:34.199
is the kind of feeling
that makes you smile

34:34.960 --> 34:36.920
even when you're exhausted."

34:40.159 --> 34:41.600
Have you not read it before?

34:43.320 --> 34:44.920
It seems like our sister is a rare gem.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.679
Please enlighten me as well.

34:49.360 --> 34:50.560
If so, have you ever

34:50.639 --> 34:51.760
felt lost all of a sudden

34:51.840 --> 34:53.560
when you look in the mirror,

34:53.639 --> 34:54.520
as if your reflection

34:54.600 --> 34:55.719
is a stranger to you?

34:58.200 --> 34:59.400
No.

35:00.080 --> 35:01.600
It's because I'm so pretty.

35:03.800 --> 35:06.120
I only become illiterate
when I'm forced to make corrections

35:06.200 --> 35:07.360
to my workbooks.

35:11.200 --> 35:12.240
Jie,

35:12.320 --> 35:13.600
why are you staying home so long

35:13.680 --> 35:15.280
this time around?

35:15.840 --> 35:16.920
Yan and I feel the same.

35:17.560 --> 35:20.080
We don't believe
that you're on your annual leave.

35:21.040 --> 35:24.080
Well, I had gallbladder surgery.

35:24.800 --> 35:26.040
In addition, I was heartbroken,

35:26.120 --> 35:27.520
so I wanted to recuperate at home.

35:27.600 --> 35:29.680
-Did you have surgery?
-Were you in love?

35:29.760 --> 35:30.720
Don't shout.

35:32.400 --> 35:33.600
It was just a minor surgery.

35:33.680 --> 35:35.080
It was nothing.

35:35.160 --> 35:36.400
I didn't actually date.

35:36.480 --> 35:37.600
It was just an attempt.

35:37.680 --> 35:39.360
So

35:39.440 --> 35:41.480
you didn't miss Chen Maidong at all.

35:42.080 --> 35:43.960
You weren't
psychologically wounded either.

35:44.880 --> 35:45.920
Do you know how old I am?

35:46.000 --> 35:47.200
I'm not that dramatic.

35:48.600 --> 35:49.680
But I was happy

35:50.280 --> 35:52.120
when I saw Chen Maidong.

35:52.840 --> 35:54.800
I'll still survive
even if I don't see him.

35:55.360 --> 35:56.560
If so, between the guy

35:56.640 --> 35:57.720
whom you almost dated

35:57.800 --> 35:58.880
and Chen Maidong,

35:59.360 --> 36:00.280
who is better?

36:13.760 --> 36:14.800
Chen Maidong.

36:15.920 --> 36:17.120
If so, that guy--

36:17.200 --> 36:18.840
Let's not bring him up, okay?

36:21.480 --> 36:22.760
Relationships are tough.

36:23.760 --> 36:25.040
So are our lives.

36:25.840 --> 36:28.080
There's no end to our suffering.

36:31.160 --> 36:32.680
Let me give you a piece of advice.

36:34.040 --> 36:35.120
What is it?

36:35.200 --> 36:36.560
Stop looking into the mirror.

36:36.640 --> 36:37.920
Go and socialize with people.

36:41.720 --> 36:42.600
By the way, Jie,

36:42.680 --> 36:44.120
help me look after Jisan Goose

36:44.200 --> 36:46.040
after I return to school tomorrow.

36:46.120 --> 36:47.320
Don't let Mom braise it.

36:47.400 --> 36:49.080
Are you not quitting school anymore?

36:50.360 --> 36:51.600
I've figured it out.

36:52.200 --> 36:53.880
I have to be educated
before doing anything.

36:56.000 --> 36:58.360
I knew that my brother
would figure things out.

36:58.440 --> 37:00.440
As for your goose,
you'll have to ask He Niaoniao.

37:00.520 --> 37:02.320
After all, I won't
be staying here for long.

37:06.520 --> 37:07.960
I may be a terrible teammate,

37:08.880 --> 37:10.120
but she isn't.

37:14.040 --> 37:17.240
Actually, she is
the most reliable one among us.

37:18.160 --> 37:20.120
After all, she inherited Mr. He's genes.

39:47.480 --> 39:54.160
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
